<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1883</h1><p class="ref-lede">1883 in world history: 19 events, 33 births, 19 deaths, 3 works, 1 state founded and 1 that came to an end. 944 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
